The nums is a list of 1, 2, 3, and 4.
The last is the last position of nums.
The run is 0.
The total is 0.
For every spot from 2 to last.
The first is item (spot minus 1) of nums minus item (spot minus 2) of nums.
The second is item spot of nums minus item (spot minus 1) of nums.
If first is second, add 1 to run, otherwise set run to 0.
Add run to total.

Show total.
